Hi {Owner},

I build websites for plumbers in and around {City}. {Business Name} has strong reviews, but no site a homeowner finds when a pipe bursts or the water heater quits.

So I built a sample instead of asking for a meeting: a leak and drain request that asks where the water is, a main shut-off guide, a water heater repair-or-replace page and your licence and insurance shown plainly, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you'd like it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, then {Care Range} a month for hosting and edits. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Could we talk for ten minutes this week?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
